# Jolt styling

Read `STYLING.md` before styling. Prefer `@joltup/lists-web-components` before building custom UI. Never mix `--ss-*` tokens into these pages.

```ts
import colors from '@joltup/colors';
import styled from '@emotion/styled';
```

No hardcoded hex, no Tailwind color utilities, no raw RGB. Always include `label` on styled components.

- Static / layout: `colors.grey[100]` etc. from `@joltup/colors`.
- Hover / active / disabled: `LIST_COMPONENT_COLORS` theme pattern in `STYLING.md`.
- Use `TRASNPARENT_HOVER` / `TRASNPARENT_ACTIVE` as-is — those typos are in the source constants.

Mobile pages under `src/pages/mobile/` also use the existing mobile shell (`@/components/mobile-shell`) and `SHELL_HEX`. Do not restyle `src/App.tsx` shell chrome to satisfy this rule.
